    <dc:title>The BiDO Standard Bibliometric Measures module (BiDO-Standard-Bibliometric-Measures)</dc:title>
    <dcterms:created>2015-07-15</dcterms:created>
    <dc:description xml:lang="en">
This module of BiDO describes a list of possible bibliometric measures that can be used to define bibliometric data of publication-related entities, e.g.: h-index, e-index, journal impact factor, author citation count.

![The architecture of the BiDO-Standard-Bibliometric-Measures module.](bido-standard-bibliometric-measures.png)

</dc:description>
